{"type": "paragraph", "paragraph_id": "L3_006", "section": "附註：", "section_id": "SEC002", "page": 3, "pages": [3], "text": "(f) 於股東週年大會日期, Charles Leland Cooney 博士及其聯繫人控制合共 56,393 股股份的投 票權。 Cooney 博士及其聯繫人根據聯交所《上市規則》須並已放棄於股東週年大會上就與 向俞博士的授出有關的上文提呈決議案第 2(ii) 項及第 8 項投票。", "block_type": "list", "paragraph_role": "body", "body_only": true, "local_heading": "附註:", "source_block_ids": ["#/texts/23"], "source_block_id": "#/texts/23", "source_parsers": ["docling"], "source_parser": "docling", "source_tools": ["docling"], "bboxes": [{"page": 3, "bbox": [42.52, 349.28, 552.83, 391.15], "source_block_id": "#/texts/23", "source_parser": "docling"}], "bbox": [42.52, 349.28, 552.83, 391.15], "bbox_coordinate_system": "pdf_points_top_left", "cross_page": false, "language": "zh", "document_order": 18, "merge_method": "docling_layout_tracks_v4"}
{"type": "paragraph", "paragraph_id": "L3_007", "section": "附註：", "section_id": "SEC002", "page": 3, "pages": [3], "text": "(g) 於股東週年大會日期,許懿尹女士及其聯繫人控制合共 17,303 股股份的投票權。許女士及 其聯繫人根據聯交所《上市規則》須並已放棄於股東週年大會上就與向俞博士的授出有關 的上文提呈決議案第 8 項投票。", "block_type": "list", "paragraph_role": "body", "body_only": true, "local_heading": "附註:", "source_block_ids": ["#/texts/24"], "source_block_id": "#/texts/24", "source_parsers": ["docling"], "source_parser": "docling", "source_tools": ["docling"], "bboxes": [{"page": 3, "bbox": [42.52, 413.28, 552.7, 455.14], "source_block_id": "#/texts/24", "source_parser": "docling"}], "bbox": [42.52, 413.28, 552.7, 455.14], "bbox_coordinate_system": "pdf_points_top_left", "cross_page": false, "language": "zh", "document_order": 19, "merge_method": "docling_layout_tracks_v4"}
{"type": "paragraph", "paragraph_id": "L3_008", "section": "附註：", "section_id": "SEC002", "page": 3, "pages": [3], "text": "(h) 於股東週年大會日期, Gary Zieziula 先生及其聯繫人控制合共 43,431 股股份的投票權。 Zieziula 先生及其聯繫人根據聯交所《上市規則》 須並已放棄於股東週年大會上就與向俞博 士的授出有關的上文提呈決議案第 2(iii) 項及第 8 項投票。", "block_type": "list", "paragraph_role": "body", "body_only": true, "local_heading": "附註:", "source_block_ids": ["#/texts/25"], "source_block_id": "#/texts/25", "source_parsers": ["docling"], "source_parser": "docling", "source_tools": ["docling"], "bboxes": [{"page": 3, "bbox": [42.52, 477.28, 552.76, 519.14], "source_block_id": "#/texts/25", "source_parser": "docling"}], "bbox": [42.52, 477.28, 552.76, 519.14], "bbox_coordinate_system": "pdf_points_top_left", "cross_page": false, "language": "zh", "document_order": 20, "merge_method": "docling_layout_tracks_v4"}
{"type": "paragraph", "paragraph_id": "L3_009", "section": "附註：", "section_id": "SEC002", "page": 3, "pages": [3], "text": "(i) 於股東週年大會日期,陳樹云先生及其聯繫人控制合共 14,183 股股份的投票權。陳先生及 其聯繫人根據聯交所《上市規則》須並已放棄於股東週年大會上就與向俞博士的授出有關 的上文提呈決議案第 8 項投票。", "block_type": "list", "paragraph_role": "body", "body_only": true, "local_heading": "附註:", "source_block_ids": ["#/texts/26"], "source_block_id": "#/texts/26", "source_parsers": ["docling"], "source_parser": "docling", "source_tools": ["docling"], "bboxes": [{"page": 3, "bbox": [42.52, 541.27, 552.7, 583.14], "source_block_id": "#/texts/26", "source_parser": "docling"}], "bbox": [42.52, 541.27, 552.7, 583.14], "bbox_coordinate_system": "pdf_points_top_left", "cross_page": false, "language": "zh", "document_order": 21, "merge_method": "docling_layout_tracks_v4"}
{"type": "paragraph", "paragraph_id": "L3_010", "section": "附註：", "section_id": "SEC002", "page": 3, "pages": [3], "text": "(j) 除上述所披露者外,概無任何股份賦予持有人權利出席股東週年大會但須根據《上市規 則》 第 13.40 條所載放棄表決贊成股東週年大會上提呈的決議案。", "block_type": "list", "paragraph_role": "body", "body_only": true, "local_heading": "附註:", "source_block_ids": ["#/texts/27"], "source_block_id": "#/texts/27", "source_parsers": ["docling"], "source_parser": "docling", "source_tools": ["docling"], "bboxes": [{"page": 3, "bbox": [42.52, 605.27, 552.56, 631.14], "source_block_id": "#/texts/27", "source_parser": "docling"}], "bbox": [42.52, 605.27, 552.56, 631.14], "bbox_coordinate_system": "pdf_points_top_left", "cross_page": false, "language": "zh", "document_order": 22, "merge_method": "docling_layout_tracks_v4"}
{"type": "paragraph", "paragraph_id": "L3_011", "section": "附註：", "section_id": "SEC002", "page": 3, "pages": [3], "text": "(k) 除上述所披露者外,概無任何本公司股東須根據《上市規則》在股東週年大會上就所提呈 的決議案放棄投票。", "block_type": "list", "paragraph_role": "body", "body_only": true, "local_heading": "附註:", "source_block_ids": ["#/texts/28"], "source_block_id": "#/texts/28", "source_parsers": ["docling"], "source_parser": "docling", "source_tools": ["docling"], "bboxes": [{"page": 3, "bbox": [42.52, 653.27, 552.67, 678.78], "source_block_id": "#/texts/28", "source_parser": "docling"}], "bbox": [42.52, 653.27, 552.67, 678.78], "bbox_coordinate_system": "pdf_points_top_left", "cross_page": false, "language": "zh", "document_order": 23, "merge_method": "docling_layout_tracks_v4"}
{"type": "paragraph", "paragraph_id": "L4_001", "section": "附註：", "section_id": "SEC002", "page": 4, "pages": [4], "text": "(l) 除上述所披露者外,概無任何人士於本公司通函內表示有意於股東週年大會上就所提呈的 任何決議案投反對票或放棄投票。", "block_type": "list", "paragraph_role": "body", "body_only": true, "local_heading": null, "source_block_ids": ["#/texts/30"], "source_block_id": "#/texts/30", "source_parsers": ["docling"], "source_parser": "docling", "source_tools": ["docling"], "bboxes": [{"page": 4, "bbox": [42.52, 45.3, 552.75, 70.81], "source_block_id": "#/texts/30", "source_parser": "docling"}], "bbox": [42.52, 45.3, 552.75, 70.81], "bbox_coordinate_system": "pdf_points_top_left", "cross_page": false, "language": "zh", "document_order": 24, "merge_method": "docling_layout_tracks_v4"}
